  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Chaos_Fade_General.jpg\" title=\"Chaos Fade General\"><img alt=\"Chaos Fade General\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"242\" src=\"/images/Chaos_Fade_General.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Chaos_Fade_General.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Chaos Fade General</div></div></div>\n<p>Fade Generals are the backbone of the Fade Army. They are reasonably proficient melee fighters with an ability similar to Holy Roller: a rushing attack that stuns and knock-backs their target. Be wary, for they are able to use this attack quite often.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Fade\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fighter\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chaos Fade General\n</td><td>None\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Path\" title=\"Embercore Path\">Embercore Path</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Fade Officer\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Abyss Milll</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Grave Forge</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Fade General\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Plague_Plant\" title=\"Plague Plant\">Plague Plant</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>,The <a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Path\" title=\"Embercore Path\">Embercore Path</a>, level 1 - 4,The <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a> Mezzanine, level 5 - 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Fade General\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Widower's Nest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ebon Fade General\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fire Fade General\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Daze_Pustain's_Pad\" title=\"Daze Pustain's Pad\">Daze Pustain's Pad</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">J'aymes Fatfilled's Pad</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Toe-Knee-Eye-Ow-My-Eye's Pad</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Fade General\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Karnage's Lot</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">The Whisker's Library - Dogma Section</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Tomb Looter\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Tomb of the AFK Bolshevist</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Specials</span></h2>\n<p><b>Crypt Kickers</b> Fire Fade General and Lichlord <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Champions\" title=\"Category:Champions\">Champions</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">J'aymz Fatfilled's Pad</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
